<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<div class="prose" data-draft="OD-15">
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>This is the website of {{ settings.name }} (RIPS), {{ settings.place }}. Contact: {{ settings.email | tbc("admissions email", "OD-04") | safe }}.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect personal details only when you send the enquiry form:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your full name and mobile or WhatsApp number;</li>
    <li>your email address, if you give one;</li>
    <li>the program you are interested in and your city;</li>
    <li>your last qualification, marks and message, if you give them;</li>
    <li>that you agreed to be contacted, and when.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The form also records which page of this website you sent it from. It does not record anything else about you or your device.</p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>Only to answer your enquiry and to contact you about admissions by phone, WhatsApp or email, which you agree to when you tick the box on the form.</p>

  <h2>Who sees it</h2>
  <p>Only our admissions team and the website administrator. We do not sell or share your details.</p>
  <p data-draft="OD-06">Enquiries are kept in a private spreadsheet that only the admissions team can open, and the admissions office is told about each new enquiry by email.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p data-draft="OD-10">We keep an enquiry for 12 months after the intake it relates to closes, then delete it.</p>

  <h2>Seeing, correcting or deleting your details</h2>
  <p>Ask the admissions office by email or WhatsApp to see, correct or delete your enquiry, or to stop contacting you. <span data-draft="OD-15">We reply within 14 days.</span></p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>This website does not set cookies and does not use analytics. If analytics are added later, they will run only after you choose Accept, and this policy will be updated first.</p>

  <h2>Other websites</h2>
  <p>Links to WhatsApp, Google Maps and YouTube open those services, which have their own privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>This website is served only over a secure (HTTPS) connection.</p>
</div>
